start/loadstep/Bode/hotshort/thermal gate explicit. 3 A continuous modem target over dry vented0..40 C is conditional on actual main-stage efficiency>=90%, actual thermal path<=32 C/W, Tj<=125 C, normal transformer aggregate and each injection-leg RMS<=0.80 A without equal-sharing credit, component/windingcase<=70 C and accepted finished metal. Initial sustained4 A dummy-load qualification uses ambient<=20 C; sustained4 A thereafter requires actual efficiency, theta/Tj and RMS qualification at that ambient. Retain4 A electrical peak capability with no asserted burst duty cycle. No35 C unconditional4 A or125 C/18 um continuous4 A rating. Installation: regulated48 V +/-5% nonisolated passive pinout with loaded FILTER>=41.562266501 V and unloaded start>=41.977840535 V. Normal waveform RMS<=0.80 A aggregate and conservative each cable/transformer injection leg, no equal sharing; measure loaded link/DC imbalance and own-windingDeltaV<=5 V/case<=70 C. Separate electronic input fault upper1.15 A for<=73 ms and prospective20 A/50 us impulse are conditional fault/thermal/SOA commissioning envelopes, never continuous magnetic ratings. Source resistive force/return1.5 ohm engineering budget is rebound to actual force metal with full real barrels/contact fans; new actual b5U21 entry replaces retired0c. Energy-only full selected97-cap charge quotient at3 A/radioOFF is8.494281 ms versus C721 faulttimer min20.9096 ms; forced4 A plus all-cap charge quotient31.657406 ms exceeds that minimum and is held. Neither quotient nor CT faultclock is a guaranteed startup waveform/deadline. Healthy input-bank qualification around407 ms and protectedPG/FCPO hardware minimum180 ms are separate events. No minimum MP4583SS is published; exact cold/hot load startup and4 A step after qualifiedPG are first-article gates. Hardware blank-MCU autostart, radioOFF and USBgrant-disabled defaults remain unchanged, with no new firmware dependency. InputVIN3 nowafter2.2uHL702/newpostLpositiveTVS;EP19 remainsSW. AllPG/UV/AON/OOB/modemhardwareauthorities unchanged." (at 0 0 0) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "d311c76f-89f9-4bb0-a79d-4b65de99315d") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/04ff4594-72fe-5fd5-8e2b-eda1d8a7648b/e6d3b80e-0fff-4ba7-8f35-4f38fa5bffde") (sheetname "/48 V passive input protection and 12 V synchronous buck") (sheetfile "class6-converter.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_rect (start -2.05 -3.05) (end 2.05 3.05) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (fill no) (layer "F.CrtYd") (uuid "fdad81bf-bc28-44bc-94b9-752ae68716e0")) (fp_rect (start -1.55 -2.55) (end 1.55 2.55) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (fill no) (layer "F.Fab") (uuid "2f74ca34-a5dd-4cc3-85ce-b708ef048973")) (pad "1" smd custom (at -1.35 -2) (size 0.05 0.05) (layers "F.Cu" "F.Mask" "F.Paste") (net "GND") (pinfunction "NC") (pintype "power_in") (options (clearance outline) (anchor rect)) (primitives (gr_poly (pts (xy -0.45 0.2) (xy -0.45 -0.2) (xy 0.15 -0.2) (xy 0.15 -0.8) (xy 0.45 -0.8) (xy 0.45 0.05) (xy 0.3 0.2)) (width 0) (fill yes))) (uuid "74ff9892-c47c-5ebe-ad73-4895d0e0bbfa")) (pad "2" smd rect (at -1.35 -1.15) (size 0.9 0.25) (layers "F.Cu" "F.Mask" "F.Paste") (net "BUCK_UVLO") (pinfunction "EN") (pintype "input") (uuid "87bd44ff-7c09-530e-868e-ae32515fa6c0")) (pad "3" smd rect (at -0.975 -0.65) (size 1.65 0.25) (layers "F.Cu" "F.Mask" "F.Paste") (net "PASSIVE_BUCK_IN") (pinfunction "VIN") (pintype "power_in") (uuid "972e2d67-d8f6-525e-9698-167e5d1f0a45")) (pad "4" smd rect (at -1.35 0.65) (size 0.9 0.25) (layers "F.Cu" "F.Mask" "F.Paste") (net "GND") (pinfunction "AGND") (pintype "power_in") (uuid "4f07218e-02d3-5a0c-93ec-1156e01aa534")) (pad "5" smd rect (at -1.35 1.15) (size 0.9 0.25) (layers "F.Cu" "F.Mask" "F.Paste") (net "unconnected-(U1-TM-Pad5)") (pinfunction "TM") (pintype "no_connect") (uuid "91bd7878-e855-5a83-97a6-d6e9eba4d401")) (pad "6" smd custom (at -1.05 2.1) (size 0.05 0.05) (layers "F.Cu" "F.Mask" "F.Paste