/service/IFB-only historical screen gave3.9454304..4.1682550V before physical quiet/sense/ripple terms. This is not a current loaded-voltage guarantee. No added FB_TOP net, series part or pole. Historical frozen887 documents coupled U986 protected-load/force/input/OVLO screens for its four declared4A temperature/wall variants and all43 power domains. The final joined-revision acceptance is governed by its current bound whole-board power/finite-domain and waveform receipts; historical results do not transfer automatically. Those static screens do not establish powered loop stability or fault survival. Retain actual waveform, loaded voltage/RON, heat, startup, ripple/noise, compensation/load-step and pre-modem dummy-load fault characterization; higher4.4A/thinner-Cu diagnostics are not admitted operating ratings." (at 0 0 180) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "f7aa42cd-b3af-46d8-87cd-e59ee13a9d55") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "Manufacturer" "YAGEO" (at 0 0 180) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "57149348-9561-43d7-aa00-edf80d8fbbd5") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "MPN" "RT0402BRD0757K6L" (at 0 0 180) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "0fd2d6a9-c427-4546-bd6b-ab1ca140f461") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/b78b40e8-3925-5223-8570-e55b94f093e5/acdc8a2b-8036-47cc-8d93-8aa48b6d0838") (sheetname "/Protected 12 V bus and regulated low-voltage rails") (sheetfile "power-rails.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start -0.153641 -0.38) (end 0.153641 -0.38) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "97cb9dc0-f465-4f46-b6ff-0aa91d6066dd")) (fp_line (start -0.153641 0.38) (end 0.153641 0.38) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "F.SilkS") (uuid "accff2f9-2402-4cf3-a464-7763d2c099dd")) (fp_rect (start -0.93 -0.47) (end 0.93 0.47) (stroke (width 0.05) (type solid)) (fill no) (layer "F.CrtYd") (uuid "481e6563-5357-48db-9c84-0c8cb74