lkS") (hide yes) (uuid "320b009f-2df3-4dfd-903b-ded14c7e4858") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "Note" "TMUX1511 PW14: channels1/2 retain paired USB between modem and ownership mux, gated by USB_GATE; channel3 retains hardware RM520 RESET67 sink through S3 GND/D3 RESET and OOB_MODEM_RESET. Channel4 isolates the modem eFuse current monitor from ESP32 GPIO9 when independent AON is not power-good: S4 pin12=MODEM_IMON_TO_ISOLATOR, D4 pin11=OOB_ADC_MODEM_CURRENT, SEL4 pin13=AON_PG; VDD14 remains protected V3V7. Current-native footprint remains F12.6,79.0/90 degrees. R756 is the fitted 1M ILM observer branch; R757 is the fitted MCU-side 100k pull-down. The S4 ordinary tented 0.55/0.20 receiver at12.3,74.3 and D4 literal Type7 0.40/0.15 terminal receiver preserve existing USB/reset copper and the actual source-reference areas. No ADC capacitor is placed directly on raw ILM. Published powered-off VDD0 leakage is not a claim for arbitrary partial VDD. The engineering transfer tolerance, partial-rail states, powered-off injection, 150ms settling, calibration, ramp/fault and firmware commissioning gates remain in the companion power qualification packet." (at 0 0 90) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "1b23eb07-bdff-47a0-92fe-b9f722f22a25") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (at 0 0 90) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "eda7559f-5d67-493e-babc-446c9c2005d6") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "MPN" "TMUX1511PWR" (at 0 0 90) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "df218d07-8b43-4249-be09-af0b40e9dd5b") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/f887535a-a945-5cc0-9489-1072ba674005/2752542f-526e-48ca-b6c2-7415e34c2a6b") (sheetname "/RM520N-GL primary / RM551E-GL compatible M.2 socket, SIM 1, eUICC (SIM 2), USB-C") (sheetfile "modem-interfaces.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start 2.31 -2.61) (end 2.31 -2.41) 