 VCCB23/24 locally; require cold native typed/package/pad proof and switched-off injection measurement. Configuredphysicalsymbol types explicitlyfixbits1:4A→B andbits5:8B→A from officialfunctiontable OELOW/DIR1HIGH/DIR2HIGH. Enforcedsourceguard pins2/11=AON_3V3/pin1=AON_3V3; OE reviewed RUN&PGdisable remains, bothrailoffisolation unchanged. ThusB8pin14 GND is a realunusedinput and A8pin10NC a realunusedoutput. IfeitherDIRnet changes, rejectconfiguredsymbol and rerun allroles/defaults. No blanketERCwaiver. A5/physical7 drives the MCU MISO through R825150ohm; MISO source damping is passive and does not change OE or rail-isolation authority. Physical9 DIO1 driver now feeds common22ohm R828.1 through2.3676mm F/B and the ordinary80.2,31.63 transition. R828.2 feeds unchanged U800 physical21/GPIO15 through the default In2/In3 receiver path. Direction and OE/startup safety logic remain unchanged; source damping and IRQ-register/level qualification are first-prototype provisions, not guaranteed loaded edge performance." (at 0 0 0) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "1f7ad0e5-4254-4094-ab5a-f853352f1ead") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (at 0 0 0) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "1be80725-8eeb-4ed2-af3a-1ac397aa3cc4") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "MPN" "SN74AXC8T245PWR" (at 0 0 0) (layer "F.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "f0dccff6-4a3f-400b-ba46-06c1090bd41c") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/f042a552-6584-5720-99fd-b114398e5849/9e860c07-96af-4cab-bc96-0b8c31e48a85") (sheetname "/OOB controller, US915 radio and recovery interface") (sheetfile "oob-controller-radio.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_poly (pts (xy 3.656502 -3.270657) (xy 3.700166 -3.299834) (xy 3.729341 -3.343495) (xy 3.737 -3.381997) (xy 3.736999 -3.767998) (xy 3.729343 -3.806502) (xy 3.700166 -3.850166) (xy 3.656505 -3.879341) (xy 3.618003 -3.887) (xy 3.407 -