ry. All four ports remain inputs with internal pullups enabled; no P3 interrupt or output control. Default LOW load is bounded to 100uA per used port on the common AON supply. Bus NACK, stuck, timeout or stale data means UNKNOWN, never GOOD. Rail/current ADC and independent STOP/RESET/autostart remain bus independent. The final joined-revision source/routing/GND/reference receipts govern the assembled revision. Historical observer1539/pullup1545 static sink/rise/capacitance sensitivity screens remain bounded qualification provenance, not a guaranteed measured bus capacitance. Retain sealed-flat-cap/CAM and first-article bus capacitance, VOL, rise, supply ramp, temperature, leakage and failure-injection measurements; MCU/TMP102 capacitances are typical-only inputs, not guaranteed whole-board bus capacitance." (at 0 0 0) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "7ab94af3-cb04-4624-8e7f-bf013be1708d") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "LCSC" "" (at 0 0 0) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "b7991c86-600f-4120-89cc-2637fb97b7b4") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/229935cf-90b2-58d3-a14f-c3f095b25ed6/740e1ada-899a-496c-91f0-7f3e51f1c6bd") (sheetname "/OOB monitoring, power control and modem recovery") (sheetfile "oob-management.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start 1.25 -1.25) (end 1.25 1.25) (stroke (width 0.1) (type solid)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "cd3c33d5-87a0-510c-956d-eee60f40ba33")) (fp_line (start -1.25 -1.25) (end 1.25 -1.25) (stroke (width 0.1) (type solid)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "150a087d-2a58-5c6f-9e1b-f49f7b6d20f9")) (fp_line (start 1.25 1.25) (end -1.25 1.25) (stroke (width 0.1) (type solid)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "0bb080e6-5b21-56de-b841-5b4cf1cbb4d4")) (fp_line (start -1.25 1.25) (end -1.25 -1.25) (stroke (width 0.1) (type solid)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "c4f27023-eecc-545a-8e4b-64adb953862d")) (fp_line (start 1.75 -1.85) (end -1.75 -1.85) (stroke (width 0.05) (typ