vice-pad pullup, no MCU disable access. Falling WDI pulse>=500ns; firmware use>=1us pulse and<=1s health-progress heartbeat. New WDO net through1.8kR814 into EN bounds capacitor-discharge current; common20kR800 pullup gives valid LOW to both MCU and USB gates. WD_EN toggle requires200us hold; service jumper>=1ms. Below0.9V WDO undefined but MCU supply below operation. Missing firmware causes repeated MCU reset while modem defaults ON/radio OFF; hardware fault monitors remain independent. New authentic DDF8 host; no exposedpad9. Final physical/net/source parity and scope timing test required." (at 0 0 0) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "a1b1c891-8c41-4d54-abc7-f8e9a905c1c3") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "Manufacturer" "Texas Instruments" (at 0 0 0) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "b4dee2d2-5bb9-424b-b397-4b547e435b8d") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (property "MPN" "TPS3435CAKAGDDFR" (at 0 0 0) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "8d4cf3e4-a004-42bc-9d23-7c0d9ccdb23d") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/f042a552-6584-5720-99fd-b114398e5849/7c41aa20-fe04-4a47-9ef3-36661d957253") (sheetname "/OOB controller, US915 radio and recovery interface") (sheetfile "oob-controller-radio.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_rect (start -2.075 1.7) (end 2.075 -1.7) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (fill no) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "d69958d8-6cc3-44ce-be15-2e40c2156276")) (fp_rect (start -0.8 1.45) (end 0.8 -1.45) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (fill no) (layer "B.Fab") (uuid "f5ea4011-69a2-4664-8d35-41dcd52dd0eb")) (pad "1" smd roundrect (at -1.3 0.975) (size 1.05 0.45) (layers "B.Cu" "B.Mask" "B.Paste") (roundrect_rratio 0.05) (net "GND") (pinfunction "SET0") (pintype "input") (uuid "84fff4dd-eee7-5acc-95f7-9924293ff4ee")) (pad "2" smd roundrect (at -1.3 0.325) (size 1.05 0.45) (layers "B.Cu" "B.Mask" "B.Paste") (roundrect_rratio 0.05) (net "AON_PG") (pinfunct