 plus outputthreshold. R755 holds EN LOW when its hardware driver is absent. With a blank/reset MCU, R741 holds Q740 OFF and R752 makes RUN HIGH; POWER_OK-qualified U531 automatically starts both converter and eFuse. Protected PG plus U16 hardware qualifies FCPO release after180..420ms. Commanded recovery firmware must hold jointEN LOW>=5s and prove actualOUT<100mV under the bounded charge/injection contract; waveform/ripple/thermal/fault and coarseADC commissioning separate." (at 0 0 0) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "c2803af3-338b-4ffc-b00b-9b8fbf10ab8a") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)))) (path "/b78b40e8-3925-5223-8570-e55b94f093e5/dc07fdaa-e94a-4079-8a61-04bbfcd32aec") (sheetname "/Protected 12 V bus and regulated low-voltage rails") (sheetfile "power-rails.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start -1.45 1.45) (end 1.45 1.45) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "66f1b41f-19f3-450c-9843-9828c5f2a24f")) (fp_line (start 1.45 1.45) (end 1.45 -1.45) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "9edc98ce-d9cb-4697-9f9f-24b7a79ae254")) (fp_line (start -1.45 -1.45) (end -1.45 1.45) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "04ae9b9e-f303-4945-b7bc-fb895ff36d4b")) (fp_line (start 1.45 -1.45) (end -1.45 -1.45) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "e6158cb1-4ad7-4e35-915c-8664dbf35658")) (fp_line (start -1 1) (end 1 1) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (layer "B.Fab") (uuid "7d8babdd-e7de-4bab-a79d-0c0b323c8955")) (fp_line (start 1 1) (end 1 -1) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (layer "B.Fab") (uuid "5e6d66c3-a7dd-4e9f-8807-fa25c5cfc894")) (fp_line (start -1 -1) (end -1 1) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (layer "B.Fab") (uuid "73816f22-509c-445f-b254-9b00f9dbc711")) (fp_line (start 1 -1) (end -1 -1) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (layer "B.Fab") (uuid "793ec4f0-8728-490a-8de6-b2853c7b1624")) (pad "1" smd custom (at -0.9