e alias of retained carrier:MPS_MP2386_QFN11_2x2; no PAD/net/pose/defaults change. LS valley6..9A replaces7..11A; conservative fullstatic4.03A+REG250u charge1A+OUT1750u C741 charge0.20055A=5.23055A<6A. Maximum9A is a valley threshold, not a guaranteed peak clamp. L981 hot differentialL/saturation/directREG short pulse, protectedOUT fault, switching ring and actual>=88% efficiency/thermal/stability remain first-article gates. Typical HS/LS36/12mOhm and EVM34C/W are not guaranteed actual loaded performance. Same590..610mV REF,1.1..2.3ms SS, EN/UVLO/5uA SWleakage; retain>=5s jointEN LOW ANDactualOUT<100mV recovery, independentAON/LoRa, hardware>=180ms FCPO qualification, blankMCU autostart, radioOFF and USBgrant-disabled reset defaults. P/Z reel-size-only equivalence is primary documented; CGG FCCM is not substituted. Manufacturing/commissioning/supply conditions are in MP2386-supply770 frozen779 and failure793." (at 0 0 90) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "584d0ce2-e327-4686-a63c-c02265abc536") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify mirror))) (property "LCSC" "" (at 0 0 90) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "0b09373f-f046-486d-92ad-a2387cbd758c") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify mirror))) (path "/b78b40e8-3925-5223-8570-e55b94f093e5/3ae32f41-3f5f-4a37-8014-a0147225a475") (sheetname "/Protected 12 V bus and regulated low-voltage rails") (sheetfile "power-rails.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start -1.1 1.45) (end -0.9 1.45) (stroke (width 0.1) (type default)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "ce4300c3-d820-42e7-89e1-a660270604b0")) (fp_line (start -1.55 1.6) (end 1.55 1.6) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "bba69c21-a8a3-46c0-a918-ec68768bc2c5")) (fp_line (start 1.55 1.6) (end 1.55 -1.6) (stroke (width 0.05) (type default)) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "c3888854-47fd-44f5-b5c8-c7b60dacba38")) (fp_line (start -1.55 -1.6) (end -1.55 1.6) (stroke (width 0.05) (type defau