lerance, host and pins as incumbent Murata. Power owner accepts role equivalence with no required hard DC-biased capacitance floor. This maintains the 100V component rating; it does not assert system galvanic isolation. The selected input TVS/enclosure/transient envelope and physical EMI/link behavior remain full-stage checks. Place on B at the reviewed compact back-side center-tap/Bob Smith bank; preserve literal VC-to-cap-to75ohm-toBS_STAR topology. The AC branch provides no DC input-current credit. Final CT-force, source, shield/return and actual six-layer geometry remain mandatory." (at 0 0 180) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "4e4392a0-acc0-47cc-b627-315653da98f8") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify mirror))) (property "Manufacturer" "KEMET / YAGEO" (at 0 0 180) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "70d8c921-7e12-4099-bb64-79a94f347a08") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify mirror))) (property "MPN" "C0805C223K1RACTU" (at 0 0 180) (layer "B.SilkS") (hide yes) (uuid "301ed454-da01-4d79-a849-bed1fc6eecd0") (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify mirror))) (path "/a1fef339-6394-5d41-9f3f-b44b85cc006e/235381ed-1294-4d1b-b959-c938977b0b74") (sheetname "/Passive cable-power connections and protected auxiliary DC") (sheetfile "power-input.kicad_sch") (attr smd) (duplicate_pad_numbers_are_jumpers no) (fp_line (start -0.261252 -0.735) (end 0.261252 -0.735) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "9d09a319-0385-4fc9-8609-a9057d3d478a")) (fp_line (start -0.261252 0.735) (end 0.261252 0.735) (stroke (width 0.12) (type solid)) (layer "B.SilkS") (uuid "7ad90098-47cf-4ac0-8973-52b8b85bb0f5")) (fp_rect (start -1.7 0.98) (end 1.7 -0.98) (stroke (width 0.05) (type solid)) (fill no) (layer "B.CrtYd") (uuid "8304a313-8fa2-4ef2-99dd-da1183be43f7")) (fp_rect (start -1 0.625) (end 1 -0.625) (stroke (width 0.1) (type solid)) (fill no) (layer "B.Fab") (uuid "22ba128f-5d0d-422f-8717-c1db339cf67c")) (fp_